cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If these tutorials or scripts helped your research, please cite this repository."
title: "DFT-Tutorials: First-principles calculation tutorials and scripts for VASP, Gaussian, CP2K and OpenMX"
abstract: >-
  Detailed Chinese-language tutorials, ready-to-run example inputs and helper scripts
  for density functional theory (DFT) calculations with VASP, Gaussian, CP2K and OpenMX,
  plus machine-learning-potential (NEP/GPUMD) utilities and a curated list of related GitHub resources.
authors:
